WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.545
- There's this
incredible axis point

00:00:03.545 --> 00:00:05.589
of what you're great
at and what you love.

00:00:05.589 --> 00:00:09.342
When you stumble into
being somebody like me,

00:00:10.482 --> 00:00:13.902
you really win when what
you're naturally great at

00:00:13.902 --> 00:00:17.238
is what you naturally
love the most, and away you go.

00:00:17.238 --> 00:00:19.032
The amount of people
that I meet every day

00:00:19.032 --> 00:00:21.367
that are great at something
but have no interest

00:00:21.367 --> 00:00:22.619
in being a CFO.

00:00:22.619 --> 00:00:26.289
They're insane with numbers
but they don't wanna do it.

00:00:26.289 --> 00:00:27.624
They wanna sing. Right?

00:00:29.316 --> 00:00:30.609
And so that's tough.

00:00:30.609 --> 00:00:32.527
You see it in athletics.

00:00:32.527 --> 00:00:34.279
People don't
understand athletes.

00:00:34.279 --> 00:00:36.127
The amount of
athletes that just do it

00:00:36.127 --> 00:00:38.046
because it was the
best way, in the same way

00:00:38.046 --> 00:00:40.006
that somebody goes
and becomes an accountant,

00:00:40.006 --> 00:00:41.675
and they don't love competition,

00:00:41.675 --> 00:00:43.593
and they don't love the sport.

00:00:43.593 --> 00:00:45.679
It's crazy when you look at them

00:00:45.679 --> 00:00:47.684
'cause you're like,
you're one of the 15 best,

00:00:47.684 --> 00:00:49.327
and they don't
love it which is why

00:00:49.327 --> 00:00:51.496
they're not the
greatest athlete of all-time.

00:00:51.496 --> 00:00:52.992
The greatest
athletes of all-time

00:00:52.992 --> 00:00:55.745
are the ones who
love it and have it.

00:00:55.745 --> 00:00:58.247
And so I think what you need
to do is taste everything.

00:00:58.247 --> 00:00:59.287
It's kind of like food.

00:00:59.287 --> 00:01:00.418
You don't know what
your favorite food is

00:01:00.418 --> 00:01:02.502
if you only eat one food.

00:01:02.502 --> 00:01:04.003
So I would take
advantage of your youth

00:01:04.003 --> 00:01:07.516
and your flexibility at this age

00:01:07.516 --> 00:01:10.763
and try to taste everything,
play with everything,

00:01:10.763 --> 00:01:12.482
figure out what
you might be good at,

00:01:12.482 --> 00:01:14.856
what you might like, and
then you make a decision.

00:01:14.856 --> 00:01:18.856
(light music)

